{"276890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FATE: Undiscovered Realms", "steam_appid": 276890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "FATE fans! You asked for it and we delivered. FATE: Undiscovered Realms, the dungeon crawl-ier sequel to our classic dungeon crawler, is now available! Import your characters from the original FATE and start a new adventure today!<br>Welcome, Hero. The manxome scourge has retreated into the shadows and you are victorious… but all is not well. A new evil and ancient secrets threaten the very balance between the realms. Take on the quest to find the mysterious Book of Fate and save your beloved Grove once again! <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\tNEW Steam Trading Cards – We made brand-new, never-before-seen art just for you. (and not because we're huge FATE nerds)<br></li><li>\tNEW Steam Badges – Shiny new nuggets of awesome for your collection. <br></li><li>\tNEW Steam Emoticons – I FATE you. <br></li><li>\tNEW Profile Backgrounds – Remind yourself of your amazing, classic, dungeon crawler adventure with these beautiful, Steam-exclusive backgrounds. <br></li><li>\tMore Than FATE – Oh, yes. Things just Got Real. This sequel has more pet transformations, dungeons, weapons, monsters and quests than the original.<br></li><li>\tGameplay – It’s HARDCORE! Don’t worry; the gameplay will be the familiar, classic RPG style that fans of the original love, but with an optional Hardcore mode. For the super-est of fans. **Insert sick guitar riff**<br></li><li>\tProcedurally generated levels – Adventure through endless caverns, dungeons, mines, tunnels, temples, forests, and snowy wastelands. Read as “Endless FUN,” am I right?<br></li><li>\tEconomy – Of course, you can still buy, sell and gamble your fat loots!<br></li><li>\tClassic – It’s the classic sequel to a classic game. Why haven’t you played it yet?</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "FATE fans! You asked for it and we delivered. FATE: Undiscovered Realms, the dungeon crawl-ier sequel to our classic dungeon crawler, is now available! Import your characters from the original FATE and start a new adventure today!<br>Welcome, Hero. The manxome scourge has retreated into the shadows and you are victorious… but all is not well. A new evil and ancient secrets threaten the very balance between the realms. Take on the quest to find the mysterious Book of Fate and save your beloved Grove once again! <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\tNEW Steam Trading Cards – We made brand-new, never-before-seen art just for you. (and not because we're huge FATE nerds)<br></li><li>\tNEW Steam Badges – Shiny new nuggets of awesome for your collection. <br></li><li>\tNEW Steam Emoticons – I FATE you. <br></li><li>\tNEW Profile Backgrounds – Remind yourself of your amazing, classic, dungeon crawler adventure with these beautiful, Steam-exclusive backgrounds. <br></li><li>\tMore Than FATE – Oh, yes. Things just Got Real. This sequel has more pet transformations, dungeons, weapons, monsters and quests than the original.<br></li><li>\tGameplay – It’s HARDCORE! Don’t worry; the gameplay will be the familiar, classic RPG style that fans of the original love, but with an optional Hardcore mode. For the super-est of fans. **Insert sick guitar riff**<br></li><li>\tProcedurally generated levels – Adventure through endless caverns, dungeons, mines, tunnels, temples, forests, and snowy wastelands. Read as “Endless FUN,” am I right?<br></li><li>\tEconomy – Of course, you can still buy, sell and gamble your fat loots!<br></li><li>\tClassic – It’s the classic sequel to a classic game. Why haven’t you played it yet?</li></ul>", "short_description": "FATE fans! You asked for it and we delivered. FATE: Undiscovered Realms, the dungeon crawl-ier sequel to our classic dungeon crawler, is now available! Take up the quest to find a mysterious tome. Import your characters from the original FATE and start a new adventure today!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>